+  // --- Step 4b: Macro flat bypass (Fix G) ---
+  // Pin3D: bottom-only CTS → macro net has ~7 sinks (<15) → single-buffer flat
+  //   topology → macro latency ~563ps, balanced with registers (~442ps).
